# Bounded tools in a long thread

The 40-call cap does not fire on most expensive follow-ups. Those turns already carry a large prompt and then add more.

## Latest message

When the thread already has tool results, the latest user message is the whole task. Finish that and stop. Do not reopen an earlier decision or start a side investigation.

A status question or a yes/no gets at most one tool call, then the answer.

## Sliced output

Read a line range or a single symbol. Do not read a whole file. Do not read a file you already read in this turn.

Return a count, a filter, or the few lines that answer the question. Do not print a full log, a full query result, or a full command output.
